{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q55608729","formula":"C₅H₆","hill":"C5H6","elements":["H","C"],"composition":{"C":5.0,"H":6.0},"names":{"en":"Cyclopentyne","ru":"Циклопентин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Cyclopentyne is a cycloalkyne containing five carbon atoms in the ring. Due to the ideal bond angle of 180° at each atom of the alkyne but the structural requirement that the bonds form a ring, this chemical is a highly strained structure, and the triple bond is highly reactive. The triple bond easily undergoes both [2+2] and [4+2] cycloaddition reactions.","ru":"Циклопенти́н — органическое соединение с химической формулой C5H6. Представляет собой ненасыщенный углеводород, структура которого включает одно пятичленное кольцо и одну тройную углерод-углеродную связь. Циклопентин относится к классу циклоалкинов."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":14093813,"mass":66.1,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CC#CC1","inchikey":"CPGPQFYAGKHQTB-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"cyclopentyne","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"flat","source":"rdkit","ref":"14093813","atoms":11,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"flat","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":-0.573,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.214,"y":0.309,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.75,"y":1.736,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.75,"y":1.736,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.214,"y":0.309,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.004,"y":-1.687,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.004,"y":-1.687,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":2.584,"y":0.919,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":1.964,"y":-0.99,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.964,"y":-0.99,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.584,"y":0.919,"z":0.0,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,1,1.0],[1,2,1.0],[2,3,3.0],[3,4,1.0],[4,0,1.0],[0,5,1.0],[0,6,1.0],[1,7,1.0],[1,8,1.0],[4,9,1.0],[4,10,1.0]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q55608729","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https:/